Make session auto-naming use the optional modelRoles.sessionNamer setting.
Naming calls the Kimchi gateway, so reject other providers in the role parser
and keep upstream's model when unset or invalid. Preserve the role across
settings saves and Ollama augmentation without adding it to /multi-model;
Ollama augmentation now copies every role, so it also stops dropping a
configured compactor.
Exercise settings resolution through the naming request and work attribution.

